      "text": "[7:15p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good in and out of VI at the moment.\n\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe is good;\n- Kofo Abayomi is good;\n- Ahmadu Bello Way is good;\nTraffic approaching Eko Hotel Roundabout is a bit slow.\n- Adeola Odeku is good;\n- Ajose Adeogun is good;\n- Adetokunboh Ademola is good;\n- Aboyade Cole is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
